.TH C0 1 "August 2026" "V7 toolchain" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
c0 \- V7 C compiler first pass (parser)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B c0
.I source temp1 temp2
.RI [ profileflag ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B c0
parses C source and emits the intermediate tree on
.I temp1
and string constants on
.IR temp2 .
It is the first pass of the V7 compiler, hosted on a modern machine.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR c1 (1)
